{
    "version": 6,
    "bundle": "L4XKVJEXWADUEM2EXGJ6CQNLAYLSPIQC",
    "type": "story",
    "storyId": "041118003",
    "title": "その魂は迷っている",
    "enTitle": "A Lost Soul",
    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "（――彼女から感じた、あの気配……。\nまるで、得体の知れない怪物――）",
            "enText": "(The aura I felt from her… was like that \nof an unfathomable monstrosity…)",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "origClipLength": 252,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 381,
                    "pathId": -7576853067289338682
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 28,
                    "pathId": 5794359813266315067
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -1967501270072406607,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "――バカバカしい。\n……勝ったのは私なのよ……？",
            "enText": "…This is ridiculous. <i>I</i> emerged victorious in the end!",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "origClipLength": 134,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 176,
                    "pathId": -6507606708177303192
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 50,
                    "pathId": -6157429684543675571
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 80,
                    "pathId": 2701436157711977442
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 8415328672801226156,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "私はいったい、なにを恐れてるっていうの……？",
            "enText": "Whyever should I be fearful of her…?",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "origClipLength": 131,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 102,
                    "pathId": -6214854940640455100
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -121303858934504916,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "見知らぬウマ娘と併走していたアドマイヤグルーヴの背中が、\nグラウンドから遠ざかっていく。",
            "enText": "After running the track with that horsegirl I wasn't \nfamiliar with, Admire Groove left.",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "origClipLength": 102,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "なんだか、余裕がなさそうだ",
                    "enText": "I get the feeling something's bothering her.",
                    "nextBlock": 5
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "なんだか、余裕がなさそう",
                    "enText": "I get the feeling something's bothering her.",
                    "nextBlock": 5
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 8172810889574829555,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "結果は、アドマイヤグルーヴの危なげない勝利。\nなのに勝ったはずの彼女のほうが苛立ちながら去っていった――",
            "enText": "She had won their race with a decent margin. \nEven so, she cut an irritated figure as I watched \nher depart.",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "origClipLength": 112,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "pathId": 5709622163369255107,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "？？？",
            "enName": "???",
            "jpText": "“LOST”――",
            "enText": "LOST…",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "origClipLength": 43,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "……え？",
                    "enText": "…Huh?",
                    "nextBlock": 7
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -5976445430194109055,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ネオユニヴァース",
            "enName": "Neo Universe",
            "jpText": "“シグナル”が……“LOST”へ向かってる……ね。",
            "enText": "Her Signal… is becoming LOST…",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "origClipLength": 174,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 144,
                    "pathId": -6558254890906175450
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -7901073815715273894
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -208403142851487443,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "彼女は……たしか、アドマイヤグルーヴと同時期デビューと\n目される有望株のひとり……ネオユニヴァースと言っただろうか。",
            "enText": "If I'm not mistaken, this girl is Neo Universe. One of Admire \nGroove's peers who debuted around the same time… and a \npromising prospect in her own right.",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "origClipLength": 120,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "シグナル……ロスト……？何の話を……？",
                    "enText": "Her signal is… lost…? What do you mean?",
                    "nextBlock": 9
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 250,
                    "pathId": -3453337455733862513
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 4042050697730237251,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ネオユニヴァース",
            "enName": "Neo Universe",
            "jpText": "魂が……“迷子”……。",
            "enText": "Her soul… is going astray…",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "origClipLength": 109,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 89,
                    "pathId": 8420219748074794472
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 3992945404338858513,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ネオユニヴァース",
            "enName": "Neo Universe",
            "jpText": "アドマイヤグルーヴは――“辿り着けない”……かも。\n“CONT”の“修復”が必要――",
            "enText": "Perhaps Admire Groove struggles to Reach… \nCONT must be restored.",
            "nextBlock": 11,
            "origClipLength": 346,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 117,
                    "pathId": -1487963245175621608
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 30,
                    "pathId": 7792143515707316933
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 3668018993227507131,
            "blockIdx": 10
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "ネオユニヴァースはあれからこちらの呼びかけに応じることなく、\n何処かへ行ってしまった。",
            "enText": "Without responding to any further form of communication, \nNeo Universe walked off and disappeared.",
            "nextBlock": 12,
            "origClipLength": 101,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "――彼女は……何が言いたかったんだろう？",
                    "enText": "What… did she want to tell me?",
                    "nextBlock": 12
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 117,
                    "pathId": -4483847471276687454
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -1180022788073264495,
            "blockIdx": 11
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エアグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Air Groove",
            "jpText": "……む？\nそこのトレーナー、ちょっといいか。",
            "enText": "…Oh? Could I have a word, Trainer?",
            "nextBlock": 13,
            "origClipLength": 156,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "え……？ええと……俺？",
                    "enText": "Huh? You mean me…?",
                    "nextBlock": 13
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "え……？ええと……私？",
                    "enText": "Huh? You mean me…?",
                    "nextBlock": 13
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 50,
                    "pathId": -4732808987727058272
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -8625908325122092859
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -2090931694592096065,
            "blockIdx": 12
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エアグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Air Groove",
            "jpText": "……他にそれらしい者もおらんだろう。\n貴様、アドマイヤグルーヴと交流があるな。話しているのを見た。",
            "enText": "…Who else would I be addressing? You, you've conversed \nwith Admire Groove, haven't you? I saw you two earlier.",
            "nextBlock": 14,
            "origClipLength": 289,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "い、いや交流……というほどでは……",
                    "enText": "W-Well, I wouldn't go <i>that</i> far…",
                    "nextBlock": 14
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 179,
                    "pathId": -7228737842654213046
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -820685143623032564,
            "blockIdx": 13
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エアグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Air Groove",
            "jpText": "……この際なんでも構わん。彼女に何かあったか知らんか？\n先ほども見かけたのだが……尋常ならざる雰囲気だった。",
            "enText": "…Whatever the case, do you know if anything happened to her? \nI caught sight of her just earlier, and she… seemed to be \nin a rather strange mood.",
            "nextBlock": 15,
            "origClipLength": 330,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 193,
                    "pathId": 1357390905432934202
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 161,
                    "pathId": 4788113971503746834
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -6633771843819050775,
            "blockIdx": 14
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "細かい事情はわからないと前置きしたうえで、\n先ほど目撃した併走の事を話した……。",
            "enText": "I responded by telling her about the race I had just witnessed, \nnoting that I didn't know much more than that…",
            "nextBlock": 16,
            "origClipLength": 97,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 60,
                    "pathId": -6948515123113112477
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 30,
                    "pathId": 5751271821906192071
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 1476279228790752800,
            "blockIdx": 15
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エアグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Air Groove",
            "jpText": "――ふむ。貴様の話を聞く限り“誰かと併走して、勝った”。\n事実を並べれば、それだけか。……現状ではなんとも言えんな。",
            "enText": "…Hmm. Essentially, you're saying she ran a race with \nsomeone and won… That's not much to go on.",
            "nextBlock": 17,
            "origClipLength": 398,
            "voiceIdx": 10,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 60,
                    "pathId": 1803639934654645825
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 228968612192937251,
            "blockIdx": 16
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エアグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Air Groove",
            "jpText": "まあいい。\n今後何か気づいた事があれば共有してくれ。",
            "enText": "Oh well. If you notice anything else in the future, \nplease come talk to me.",
            "nextBlock": 18,
            "origClipLength": 145,
            "voiceIdx": 11,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "彼女のこと、すごく心配してるんだな",
                    "enText": "You're really concerned with her, huh.",
                    "nextBlock": 18
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "彼女のこと、すごく心配してるんだね",
                    "enText": "You're really concerned with her, huh.",
                    "nextBlock": 18
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 75,
                    "pathId": 3139313673409949913
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -5802317096885758930
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 1096818290763461068,
            "blockIdx": 17
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エアグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Air Groove",
            "jpText": "……ふむ。見知っているとはいえ、特段付き合いがあるわけでも\nないんだがな……どうにも気になって――",
            "enText": "…Hmm. I know her a little, but we don't have a particular \nrelationship, really… Still, I can't shake these thou—",
            "nextBlock": 19,
            "origClipLength": 314,
            "voiceIdx": 12,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 409,
                    "pathId": -7041380978812960706
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 303,
                    "pathId": -1293609637957802831
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 4650838872939516977,
            "blockIdx": 18
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エアグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Air Groove",
            "jpText": "――いや。すまん、こっちの話だ。\nとにかく、何か気づいたら教えてくれ。",
            "enText": "…No, forget that, I'm just talking to myself. \nIn any case, do let me know if something happens, will you?",
            "nextBlock": 20,
            "origClipLength": 205,
            "voiceIdx": 13,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 89,
                    "pathId": 2195277039667002535
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -8895554990641311154
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -697776222522429274,
            "blockIdx": 19
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "今日あったいろんなことが、頭の中をぐるぐると回っていた。",
            "enText": "My head was swirling with thoughts, repeating everything \nthat happened today.",
            "nextBlock": 21,
            "origClipLength": 81,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 25,
                    "pathId": -873163994788602397
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 438831368787557628,
            "blockIdx": 20
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "併走で勝ったはずのアドマイヤグルーヴが見せた、謎の苛立ち。\n彼女に関してネオユニヴァースが口にした、“ロスト”という言葉。",
            "enText": "Admire Groove's untraceable irritation after winning a race. \nThe meaning behind the word \"lost\", which Neo Universe had \nused to describe her.",
            "nextBlock": 22,
            "origClipLength": 124,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "pathId": 8556227220434825807,
            "blockIdx": 21
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "アドマイヤグルーヴがなぜか気にかかると言うエアグルーヴ。\nこれらの事象は、何を意味しているのだろうか。",
            "enText": "Air Groove, and her peculiar interest in Admire Groove. \nHow exactly do all these things link together?",
            "nextBlock": 23,
            "origClipLength": 111,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "よく……わからない。いくら考えても……",
                    "enText": "Think as I might, I… just don't know.",
                    "nextBlock": 23
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -691315314446609814,
            "blockIdx": 22
        },
        {
            "jpName": "",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "――考え事をしながら眠ったからだろうか。\nまどろみの縁で、奇妙な夢を見た。",
            "enText": "Perhaps all these thoughts were the reason for the strange \ndream I had when I drifted off to sleep.",
            "nextBlock": 24,
            "origClipLength": 93,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "pathId": 851719341090519452,
            "blockIdx": 23
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アナウンサー",
            "enName": "Announcer",
            "jpText": "アドマイヤグルーヴだッ！\n今、拳を握りしめましたッ！！",
            "enText": "Admire Groove!! Her arm raised to her chest, her fist clenched! \nFirst place is firmly in her grasp!",
            "nextBlock": 25,
            "origClipLength": 156,
            "voiceIdx": 14,
            "pathId": 5778575591955093464,
            "blockIdx": 24
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アナウンサー",
            "enName": "Announcer",
            "jpText": "スティルインラブを際どく退け、ついにGⅠ制覇……！\n『エリザベス女王杯』を制したのはアドマイヤグルーヴ……！",
            "enText": "Admire Groove narrowly beats Still in Love to take \nher first G1 victory at the Queen Elizabeth Cup…!",
            "nextBlock": 26,
            "origClipLength": 339,
            "voiceIdx": 15,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 137,
                    "pathId": 523807722030518965
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 468784094354306478
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -52153660748312581,
            "blockIdx": 25
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エアグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Air Groove",
            "jpText": "ようやく――雪辱を果たせたな。",
            "enText": "You have your vengeance — at last.",
            "nextBlock": 27,
            "origClipLength": 117,
            "voiceIdx": 16,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 149,
                    "pathId": 7343078042073382767
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -5637733636323146557
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 157,
                    "pathId": 8494596021797122055
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -8046051650936245807,
            "blockIdx": 26
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "……。一度全てを失くしかけたとき――\nこの手を掴んでくださったのは、貴方でした。",
            "enText": "…When I thought I had lost everything I had… you were \nthe one who reached out to me.",
            "nextBlock": 28,
            "origClipLength": 328,
            "voiceIdx": 17,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 344,
                    "pathId": 4540738155429408835
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 116,
                    "pathId": 2591178953498674467
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 131,
                    "pathId": 4323258308742697625
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 4790358271239118049,
            "blockIdx": 27
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "――貴方からいただいたものの全てが……私には宿っていました。\nこの脚にも……心にも。",
            "enText": "All the things you have given me… have kept me going. \nI feel them coursing through me, in my legs… in my heart.",
            "nextBlock": 29,
            "origClipLength": 298,
            "voiceIdx": 18,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 344,
                    "pathId": -4262094218903240026
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 50,
                    "pathId": 3306910943894106865
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 24,
                    "pathId": -778070325723049802
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -8443195589897826935,
            "blockIdx": 28
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エアグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Air Groove",
            "jpText": "……ふふ。散々手を焼いた後輩の言葉と考えると、感慨深いものだ。\nだが……本当に――本当に、よくやった。",
            "enText": "<i>Hmph</i>… Hearing you say that after the handful you've been \nis very touching. But, well… you really, <i>really</i> did very well.",
            "nextBlock": 30,
            "origClipLength": 427,
            "voiceIdx": 19,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 60,
                    "pathId": -5220024323065198353
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 79,
                    "pathId": 8931289669625418819
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 446,
                    "pathId": 2414968734254388787
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 97,
                    "pathId": 5743265881062275811
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 4941683208945536933,
            "blockIdx": 29
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "――……！\n……はい……！",
            "enText": "……Thank you…!",
            "nextBlock": 31,
            "origClipLength": 120,
            "voiceIdx": 20,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "（なんだかとても――優しい夢だ……）",
                    "enText": "(That was a pretty nice dream…)",
                    "nextBlock": 31
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 132,
                    "pathId": -7492459358659810292
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 170,
                    "pathId": 6566042009690723575
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 60,
                    "pathId": 6705922265967122620
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 21,
                    "pathId": 4903766098642194518
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -6063719764066700173,
            "blockIdx": 30
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "っ！？　……はぁっ……はぁっ……。\nまた、あの夢……！",
            "enText": "<i>Hahh… haah…</i> That dream again…!",
            "nextBlock": 32,
            "origClipLength": 231,
            "voiceIdx": 21,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 108,
                    "pathId": -986630499607953757
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 51,
                    "pathId": -5247060270964100300
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 132,
                    "pathId": 6379395344482489521
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 79,
                    "pathId": -6167679892630662582
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 60,
                    "pathId": -2404991887852155378
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 3126453744769500003,
            "blockIdx": 31
        },
        {
            "jpName": "アドマイヤグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Admire Groove",
            "jpText": "（トリプルティアラ……『エリザベス女王杯』、\n全てを奪われ…………）",
            "enText": "(The triple tiara… the Queen Elizabeth Cup… \nHaving everything taken from me again…)",
            "nextBlock": 33,
            "origClipLength": 203,
            "voiceIdx": 22,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 232,
