            "jpText": "昨晩の夢の事がどうにも頭から離れずグラウンドを訪れると、\n孤高のウマ娘は鬼気迫る表情で黙々とトレーニングをしていた。",
            "enText": "I returned to the track the next day, my mind still caught up \non that night's dream. A horsegirl was training in isolation, \nher face showing a rather menacing expression.",
            "nextBlock": 37,
            "origClipLength": 120,
