            "enText": "…Really a nasty \"dream\"… Why must it return again and again \nand again…! The tiara, everything after it… why do they all… \nwhy does <i>she</i> take everything from me…!",
            "nextBlock": 39,
            "origClipLength": 459,
            "voiceIdx": 27,
            "choices": [
                {
